        [
          "text",
          "Result and persistence"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "This procedure creates a file-based live installation by placing the "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "minios/"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " tree and bootloader on a normal filesystem. It is not a raw ISO write, an ISO-file multiboot setup, or a MiniOS Installer deployment."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "The chosen filesystem affects which persistence backends can work, but it does not enable persistence or guarantee that a session will be created. Persistence is enabled only when a boot entry or kernel command line requests it, and activation still requires suitable writable storage. See "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/using-minios/Boot-Modes.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Boot modes"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/reference/boot-process/Persistence-Internals.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Initrd persistence"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " before relying on saved changes."
        ]
